              "name": "=emailBody",
              "value": "={{ `Hello,<br><br>Thank you for sharing your requirements. We have reviewed them and performed an initial analysis.<br><br>To proceed further, we would like to clarify the following:<br><br><ul><li>` + $json.questionsText.split(\"\\n\").map(q => q.replace(/[•\\s-]+/, '').trim()).filter(Boolean).join(\"</li><li>\") + `</li></ul><br><br>These inputs will help us refine the scope and provide an accurate solution.<br><br>Looking forward to your response.<br><br>Regards,<br>Your Team` }}",
